  "text": "### 4. Fraud Risk  \n**Appetite:** Low  \n**Tolerance:**\n- **Annual Fraud Loss:** <£100,000 (0.3% of revenue)\n- **Fraud Detection Rate:** >96%\n- **Customer Reimbursement:** <£30k annually\n- **Internal Fraud:** Zero tolerance  \n**Rationale:**\nFirstUK Bank invests in fraud prevention systems and monitoring. Committed to protecting customers and bank assets from fraud.  \n**Controls:**\n- Advanced fraud detection engine (real-time)\n- Transaction monitoring and rules\n- Customer education and awareness\n- Investigation procedures\n- Segregation of duties  \n---",
